               <geogName xml:id="geogName_id9e997a0c"/>
            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_idf5fea05a">
               <p xml:id="idm162">Princess Alexandra (1844-1925) was the next eldest child of King Christian IX of Denmark. In September 1862 she got engaged to Queen Victoria's son Albert Edward, Prince of Wales. She left Copenhagen on 27 February 1863. It is not known whether the work was performed at the farewell party at Bernstorff Slot or the score was presented to the princess.</p>
            </history>
